      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the advice, i'll try the water and the compress. but honestly the pain is getting so bad i can't even think straight. i'm also starting to feel this weird tightness in my neck and my left arm feels kind of tingly, which is super weird for my usual migraines. since i'm already on Zoloft, would it be safe to just take 150mg of sumatriptan right now to see if it helps? i'm really trying to avoid the hospital if i can just knock this out at home.",
